Third-party material
--------------------
PartNeXt meshes and part masks are CC BY 4.0 by their authors:
    https://huggingface.co/datasets/AuWang/PartNeXt
    https://huggingface.co/datasets/AuWang/PartNeXt_mesh

The physical-property values are NOT uniformly licensed. They are drawn from a corpus of
82 sources whose licences are not mutually compatible, and each value inherits the licence
of the sources it was measured from. Every row of the annotation table carries a
`license_tier` column giving the strictest licence that applies to it:

    PERMISSIVE        85,763   CC0 / CC BY / MIT
    PUBLIC_DOMAIN     92,825   US Government works
    COPYLEFT          96,733   CC BY-SA 4.0 and ODbL -- share-alike, and mutually incompatible
    NONCOMMERCIAL_OK  41,177   ARCSim cloth database -- non-profit use only, NOT for commercial use
    SPEC_DATA_CITED   12,205   manufacturer datasheet -- cited, not relicensed
    NO_SOURCE          4,449   abstained rows, no property values

183,037 parts (54.9%) carry no share-alike or non-commercial obligation.

Attribution is a condition of use for most of the corpus. Required citations, per source,
are listed in the License section of README.md and per row in material_corpus_sources.csv.
